<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
  <style>
@@STYLE@@
    /* Compact tiles: the rule for a console carrying more than 12 apps.
       Same panel, same hairline, icon over title, six to a row. */
    .grid.compact { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
    .grid.compact .tile { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px;
                          padding: 22px 22px 20px 22px; }
    .grid.compact .tile .ico { width: 52px; height: 52px; }
    .grid.compact .tile h3 { font-size: 26px; }
    .grid.compact .tile p { font-size: 20px; }
    .sheet.dense { gap: 24px; padding-top: 28px; }
    .note { margin: 0 96px; padding: 20px 26px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            background: rgba(17,85,119,.10); color: var(--dim); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .note b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</helmet>

<div style="position: relative; width: 1920px; height: 1080px;">

  <div class="strip">
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"><div class="tab">ePADD</div></div>
    <div class="slot"><div class="tab back">engineering</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="padd">
    <div class="padd-bar">
      <div class="mark">e<em>PADD</em></div>
      <div class="bar-dim">TSN Artemis</div>
      <div class="bar-right">
        <div class="bar-dim">ENGINEERING - DEV BUILD</div>
        <div class="bar-dim">14:32</div>
        <div class="pill red">RED ALERT</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sheet dense">

      <div>
        <div class="group-head"><h2>Ship</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
        <div class="grid compact" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-cargo.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Cargo</h3><p>Hold manifest</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-fabricate.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Fabricate</h3><p>Build queue</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-upgrades.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Upgrades</h3><p>Refits</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-airwing.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Airwing</h3><p>Sortie board</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-damage.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Damage</h3><p>Repair queue</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-hangar.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Hangar</h3><p>Deck status</p></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="group-head"><h2>Mission</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
        <div class="grid compact" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-quests.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Quests</h3><p>3 running</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-library.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Library</h3><p>Codex</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-help.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Help</h3><p>Reference</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-comms_log.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Comms log</h3><p>Hail history</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-standings.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Standings</h3><p>Faction ties</p></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="group-head"><h2>Systems</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
        <div class="grid compact" style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-debug.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Debug</h3><p>Dev build</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-mast.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>MAST</h3><p>Task list</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-brain.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Brain scan</h3><p>NPC state</p></span>
          </button>
          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-coverage.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Coverage</h3><p>Label hits</p></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        <b>Past twelve apps the tiles go compact</b> - icon over title, six to a row - rather
        than paging or scrolling. Groups do the work the <em>More (n)</em> dropdown used to do,
        and unlike that dropdown nothing is hidden.
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</x-dc>

<script data-dc-script data-props='{"$preview": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080}}'>
class Component extends DCLogic {}
</script>
</body>
</html>
